        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The following services and supplies are covered under both the Preferred Dental Plan and the Prepaid Dental Plan to the specified limits. The plans pay for covered services only if those services are performed by or under the direction of a licensed dentist or other plan-approved licensed professional. A licensed dentist does not mean a dental mechanic or any other type of dental technician. Coverage is subject to the benefit payment levels, exclusions, and other provisions of each dental plan.",
