        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Examinations are covered once in a six (6)-month period. Charges to review a proposed treatment plan or for case presentation by the attending dentist are not covered. Complete mouth or panorex X-rays are covered once in a five (5)-year period. Supplementary bitewing X-rays are covered once in a twelve (12)-month period. Study and diagnostic models and decay susceptibility tests are not covered.",
